# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Business in Auberdine (97894), from Borgus Steelhand on the Stormwind visit before
# the boat (02-westfall), handed to his brother Gorbold on the first Auberdine stop.
# Split 2026-11-07 (Alliance 12-20 zone order): this guide is Darkshore's first three loops, to
# about 18; the Eastern Kingdoms loop (03-loch-modan: Loch Modan, Redridge and Westfall at 18-20)
# leaves from the Auberdine dock, and the southern and last loops (03-darkshore-return) follow it.
# The Absent Minded Prospector (729), A Lost Master (986), WANTED: Murkdeep! (4740) and Gathering
# the Cure (6123) are taken there, where their work is; Onu (948) is taken from Barithras with Cave
# Mushrooms' hand-in, and the Tower of Althalaxx (965, 966) is done on the north loop, by Buzzbox 323.

step Boat to Auberdine
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 22.71,56.69 "Boat to Auberdine" live

# Visit 3 of the simulator's consensus Alliance route (Human export,
# 16.4 to 20.5): four loops from Auberdine, then south into Ashenvale
# (06-ashenvale, since 2026-11-07; Redridge comes after the Wetlands).
# Kerlonian, Therylune and Balthule's letter (5321, 945, 967) and Trek to
# Ashenvale (990) are turned in there.
#
# Flow: Auberdine (flight path, hearth) -> the beach -> Auberdine -> the bear
# hills -> Auberdine -> the Blackwood camp, Ameth'Aran, the red crystal,
# Bashal'Aran, the Tower of Althalaxx -> hearth -> the Blackwood camp,
# Ameth'Aran, the southern beaches, the Grove, the red crystal, Cliffspring
# Falls, the northern beaches, Bashal'Aran -> Auberdine -> the bay wrecks, the
# Ruins of Mathystra, the Tower, the northern Blackwood camp, the cave, the
# Den Mother -> hearth -> the Grove, the Master's Glaive, Murkdeep's beach ->
# Auberdine -> the naga -> hearth -> the Grove, Volcor -> Auberdine.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - For Love Eternal (963) is taken on the first pass through Auberdine and
#   done in Ameth'Aran on the first loop instead of a later return.
# - Refresh (new consensus): The Absent Minded Prospector (729, 731) is
#   taken: Trouble In Darkshore? (730) is only its breadcrumb, Archaeologist
#   Hollee gives 729 directly. Its third step (741) is left out: it ends in
#   Darnassus, a detour off the route, and the chain's last step (943) needs
#   the Stone of Relu, a 1.5% raptor drop in the Wetlands.
# - Refresh: Expanding Horizons (97914, Forever) is taken at the end:
#   Thundris Windweaver's letter goes to Baros Alexston on the Stormwind stop
#   before the boat back (the end of 03-loch-modan, #1415), his reply (Making Do,
#   97926, a Shipwright's Satchel) to Thundris where the boat lands
#   (03-darkshore-return); 06-ashenvale and 06-wetlands keep both as optional
#   fallbacks for a player who still carries them.
# - Left out, accepted but never turned in on the route: One Shot. One Kill.
#   (5713): it ends at Maestra's Post (06-ashenvale, now at about 20); left
#   out for now: Sentinel Aynasha stands on Kerlonian's escort road, and how
#   her defence fits beside the escort has not been checked. The Powers Below (968) starts
#   from a 5% book drop of the Twilight Disciples and Thugs: optional, handed
#   in at the Ironforge stop (06-ashenvale).
# - The Lakeshire flight path and hearth the export lists at the end of this
#   visit are taken on arrival in Redridge (04-redridge-mountains).
# - Auberdine, on the return from Bashal'Aran: one round of the town, from
#   Terenthis by the road in to Thundris last; Thundris (4763), Terenthis
#   (986) and Gwennyth (87760) give their next quests on the same visit as
#   the turn-ins instead of a second round.
# - Holy Diver (87760, Forever): Gwennyth offers it only once all nine
#   Beached Sea Creature and Turtle quests are handed in (players'
#   reports, #51; the quest data has no prerequisite for it). It is taken
#   with the last three after the fourth loop, its rod comes from the
#   Stormscale Beastmistresses on the naga trip, and it is handed in on the
#   way back south.
# - Beached Sea Creature (4723) is taken on the first loop, on the walk from
#   Asterion down to Buzzbox 411 that passes it, and handed in at the first
#   hearth (#213), instead of a detour from Cliffspring Falls on the second.
#   The four remains past Remtravel's Excavation (4730-4733) stay on the
#   fourth loop: Greymist Oracles and Tidehunters (18-20) guard them, which
#   the second loop reaches at about 18. 4730 lies on the walk from them to
#   Murkdeep's camp, and the one west of the Grove (4728) on the walk north
#   from the Grove to Auberdine: the second loop no longer walks down the
#   coast and back for them (flow review, 2026-11-07).
# - The Blackwood Corrupted (4763, #302): the Empty Cleansing Bowl is filled
#   at the Auberdine Moonwell right after Thundris gives the quest, and the
#   three Blackwood samples, the bowl and the Talisman are a step of their
#   own at the northern Blackwood camp, on the way from the Tower to the
#   cave. The quest's only objective is the Talisman, but Xabraxxis comes
#   only for the mixed bowl.
#
# Optional: The Family and the Fishing Pole (1141) needs Fishing.
# Gyromast's Revenge (2078) ends with the Threshwackonator 4100, an elite: not
# taken. The Tower of Althalaxx 1143 and 981 need 1167 from Delgren in
# Ashenvale (after 970-973) first: skipped.
#
# Class quests (Druids; Auberdine has the flights to Rut'theran Village and
# Moonglade, the class's own teleport does the rest):
# - Night Elf Druids: A Lesson to Learn and Trial of the Lake (26, 29) after
#   the first hearth, the Darkshore half pendant on the north loop; Trial of
#   the Sea Lion (272) is finished with the Westfall half from the Stormwind
#   stop (04-redridge-mountains) at the start of 06-wetlands.
# - Night Elf and Skyborne Druids: Cat Form (98393 to 98397, Mathrengyl
#   Bearwalker, the Great Cat Spirit or the Avatar of Saeyleenan in
#   Moonglade) at the end, about level 20, before Ashenvale.
# - Night Elf Druids: Cure Poison (6121-6125: Lessons Anew from Mathrengyl on
#   the A Lesson to Learn trip, the Cliffspring sampler on the north loop,
#   Alanndarian's herbs after the third loop and the deer on the last legs,
#   Power over Poison on the Cat Form trip). Forever rewards Cure Poison only
#   through it. Earthroot needs Herbalism or the Stormwind purchase
#   (02-westfall); the moonkin caves for the Lunar Fungus are from
#   Forever's quest data (quest 6123), the Lunar Fungal Blooms objects.json's.
# - Skyborne Druids hand Sheldras's Moonglade welcome (94914, from their start
#   guide) to Dendrite on the Cat Form trip.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Auberdine

step Auberdine
  zone Darkshore
  tip The boat docks west of the village: Cerellean Whiteclaw waits where the pier meets the shore. Go up to Thundris Windweaver at the north end of the village first, then down the main street to the inn. The flight master stands on the hill south of the inn. Wizbang Cranktoggle stands upstairs in the inn: take the stairs inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  accept 963                                  -- Cerellean Whiteclaw, on the pier
  accept 954 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,Skyborne -- Thundris Windweaver, north end of the village
  accept 97914                                -- Thundris Windweaver: for Baros Alexston in Stormwind
  vendor nearest optional
  accept 958 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,Skyborne
  turnin 97894                                -- Gorbold Steelhand
  accept 982
  accept 984 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,Skyborne -- Terenthis
  accept 965                                  -- Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze
  accept 2118 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,Skyborne -- Tharnariun Treetender
  accept 4811 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,Skyborne -- Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea
  accept 947                                  -- Barithras Moonshade
  accept 98025 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,Skyborne -- The WANTED poster outside the inn
  accept 983                                  -- Wizbang Cranktoggle, upstairs in the inn
  getfp "Auberdine"
  accept 3524                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde (Night Elves have it from Teldrassil)
  accept 1138                                 -- Gubber Blump, on the pier

step Gubber Blump
  zone Darkshore
  when skill Fishing 1
  tip Fishers only: Gubber Blump stands on the pier. His Darkshore Grouper is fished from the pier itself.
  accept 1141 optional                        -- Gubber Blump, on the pier

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The beach

step The beach
  tip Tide Crawlers scuttle along the shore below the village; Buzzbox 827 stands on the beach just south of the docks. Darkshore Threshers swim in the shallows. The Beached Sea Creature lies on the shore just south of the village.
  collect 12242 quest 3524                    -- Sea Creature Bones
  collect 12238 quest 1141 optional @36.1,44.9 -- Darkshore Grouper: fish from the pier
  collect 5385 quest 983 @35.6,47.1           -- Crawler Legs
  turnin 983                                  -- Buzzbox 827
  accept 1001

step Auberdine
  turnin 3524                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde
  accept 4681                                 -- Washed Ashore: the Beached Sea Turtles up the coast offer their quests only once it is handed in
  turnin 1141 optional                        -- Gubber Blump
  sethome "Auberdine"

