  tip Rabid Thistle Bears roam the hills just east of Auberdine. Use Tharnariun's Hope on one and lead it back to him.
  complete 2118 @38.21,52.59 map 1439 era only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,Skyborne -- the Rabid Thistle Bears nearest Tharnariun
