step A Lesson to Learn
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Darnassus
  tip Fly from Auberdine to Rut'theran Village and take the portal up to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave.
  fly "Rut'theran Village"

# Mathrengyl stands upstairs in the druids' building; the walking maps have no way up inside it, so
# this goto is its door on the south side (players' recordings walk in there), not his spot (#1338).
step Darnassus
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Darnassus
  goto 35.8,11.6 "Darnassus"

step A Lesson to Learn
  only NightElf,Druid
