  goto 56.3,32.5 "Cast Teleport: Moonglade"

step Trial of the Lake
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Moonglade
  tip Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in his building in Nighthaven: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart. Shrine Baubles lie in the containers on the floor of Lake Elune'ara, below Nighthaven: take one to the Shrine of Remulos in the north-west, use it there and speak to Tajarri. Trial of the Lake runs on a timer: no teleport or Hearthstone until Tajarri has it. Then fly back to Auberdine from Nighthaven.
  turnin 26 only NightElf -- Dendrite Starblaze
  turnin 6121 only NightElf
  accept 6122 only NightElf -- The Principal Source: fill the sampler at Cliffspring Falls
  accept 29 only NightElf
  collect 15877 x1                            -- Shrine Bauble, from a Bauble Container in the lake
  use 15877 @36.0,41.4                        -- At the Shrine of Remulos
  complete 29 only NightElf
  turnin 29 only NightElf -- Tajarri
  accept 272 only NightElf -- The half pendants lie in Darkshore and Westfall: later on the route
  fly "Auberdine"

