# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Third loop: the north

step The bay wrecks
  tip Two wrecks lie on the sea floor in the bay north of Auberdine; each holds a lockbox. Reef Crawlers and Encrusted Tide Crawlers line this shore.
  tip Careful: The murlocs inside the wrecks are close together and fast. They often swim through the hull walls and holes, so you will usually pull extra murlocs.
  collect 12191 quest 982                     -- Silver Dawning's Lockbox; underwater
  collect 12192 quest 982                     -- Mist Veil's Lockbox; underwater

step Bashal'Aran
  turnin 1001                                 -- Buzzbox 411
  accept 1002

step Darkshore: kill these as you meet them
  zone Darkshore
  tip Moonstalkers prowl the hills between Bashal'Aran and the tower. Buzzbox 323 stands on the hill west of the tower.
  collect 5413 quest 1002                     -- Moonstalker Fangs

step Cliffspring River
  turnin 1002                                 -- Buzzbox 323
  accept 1003

step The Tower of Althalaxx
  tip East of Buzzbox 323, Balthule Shadowstrike hides at the foot of the tower among the Dark Strand Fanatics. Keep his letter for Delgren in Ashenvale.
  turnin 965                                  -- Balthule Shadowstrike
  accept 966
  collect 5348 quest 966 @55.8,25.9 map 1439 -- Worn Parchment: Dark Strand Fanatics
  turnin 966
  accept 967

step The cave and the Den Mother
  tip The cave lies south of the falls: Scaber Stalks grow all through it, the Death Cap at the very back. The Den Mother lairs in the hills south of the falls.
  collect 5271 quest 947                      -- Scaber Stalks; below ground
  collect 5270 quest 947                      -- Death Cap; below ground

step The northern Blackwood camp
  tip The furbolg camp south of the Cliffspring River keeps its Nut, Fruit and Grain Stores by the bonfires. With a sample of each and the Filled Cleansing Bowl in your bags (the Empty Cleansing Bowl is filled at the Auberdine Moonwell), use the bowl by the bonfire closest to the river: it summons Xabraxxis, the satyr corruptor, and the Talisman of Corruption lies in his Demon Bag.
  collect 12343                               -- Blackwood Nut Sample
  collect 12341                               -- Blackwood Fruit Sample
  collect 12342                               -- Blackwood Grain Sample
  use 12347 quest 4763.1 @52.5,33.4           -- By the bonfire closest to the river: summons Xabraxxis
  collect 12355 quest 4763                    -- Talisman of Corruption, in Xabraxxis' Demon Bag

step The cave and the Den Mother
  tip Careful: If you attack one cub, the other cubs and often the mother join the fight, so expect to take on several at the same time.
  kill 6788 quest 2139                        -- Den Mother, below ground

